Subject: [PATCH AUTOSEL 4.9 45/66] scsi: libsas: always unregister the old device if going to discover new
Date:   Sat,  9 Nov 2019 21:48:24 -0500
Message-Id: <20191110024846.32598-45-sashal@kernel.org>
